# Cross-language render benchmark

[site]: https://example.com "Example"

## Section 1

Paragraph 1 has *strong*, /emphasis/, `inline code`, and a [link][site].

- first list item
- second list item
  - nested item with *strong*
  - another nested item

> A block quote with /emphasis/ and a [direct link](https://example.com/path).

```js
function section1(value) {
  return value + 1;
}
```

| Name | Value | Note |
| --- | ---: | :--- |
| alpha | 1 | *strong* |
| beta | 2 | `code` |

